 "bio": {
  "lang": "en",
  "script": "Latn",
  "text": "Selam Fessha is a dedicated author, educator, and advocate for financial and personal wellness. As a medical biller, single mother, and community leader, she understands the power of resilience and the importance of financial literacy. Her work inspires readers to take control of their money and mindset with compassion, intention, and clarity. Through her books, Selam shares practical tools and real-life experiences to empower others on their journey toward financial freedom and purposeful living."
